move placeholder team members from AboutUs page","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"936e0ff55ff689aedc16d614df8d5e72f85285b8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add event use cases to DeveloperGuide.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":50,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"b7864999e7a874e5ca9789759c9fb3103bfd6af9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add event management to CoordiMate","messageBody":"CoordiMate has no event workflow, leaving organizers without a way to\ncreate and review events.\n\nAdd addevent with date and time validation, unique names, and persistent\nstorage. Require chronological start and end times; compare dates alone\nwhen either time is omitted. Add an Events view with selected event\ndetails and compact, clear command feedback.\n\nDocument the commands and cover validation, persistence, and UI behavior\nwith tests.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":981,"deletions":45},"docs":{"insertions":131,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":588,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"c4b9336c920ffc626e671f678f48f9aa32e662aa","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Stop tracking anti-slop audit files","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":0,"deletions":95}}},{"hash":"e69e657c7535233fcede98a2da59d8a085a545ae","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove display-dependent EventWorkspaceTest","messageBody":"EventWorkspaceTest starts JavaFX, opens windows, and captures screenshots,\nrequiring a graphical display that the provided Linux CI workflow does\nnot configure. It also exceeded its timeout when run through WSL.\n\nRemove these UI tests to preserve the current CI workflow without adding\nXvfb setup. Existing event parser, command, model, and storage tests remain.\nDevelopers will manually verify event UI behavior when making UI changes.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":0,"deletions":200}}},{"hash":"69a9a3ea1e573d42949a1584bc0b6e04a5643797","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve event storage coverage","messageBody":"Add tests for event storage conversion and validation, including\nmissing fields, invalid event details, duplicate names, null list\nentries, and round-trip preservation of events.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":94,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"684c5223a0912332b70840fad14cd000b18e411d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix error message from \"Contact\" to \"Event\"","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"2fed5fe5f64b5a539371968a738143f682fbdead","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make event duplicate detection case-insensitive","messageBody":"Treat event names that differ only by case as duplicates, while preserving\nthe capitalization entered by the user for display. This improves the\nuser experience, since a user might not intend case differences to result\nin two distinct events.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":34,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"bab656c011f354bd37366c24f09dfacf5f7f0321","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve coding standard","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":393,"deletions":211},"test-code":{"insertions":48,"deletions":40}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-06T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"a3551fef0513017a69b9a0eb2ca15e9b12ccb281","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix checkstyle problems","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":3,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"79f5578138837dd91b4b82e423e7e7062d3cdf79","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #53 from yuanshengbronze/add-event","messageBody":"Add event management to CoordiMate","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"evannathanael":[{"date":"2026-09-29T